{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-nova","sender":"LiuKan","text":"你好，我需要印章","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:06:10.537Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-nova","sender":"Nova","text":"（沉默片刻，目光从星图上移开）……暗语。","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:06:11.611Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-nova","sender":"LiuKan","text":"暗语？","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:06:19.837Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-nova","sender":"Nova","text":"（重新低头校准望远镜，声音很轻）没有暗语，就当我没说过话。","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:06:20.870Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-nova","sender":"LiuKan","text":"\"per aspera ad astra\"","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:07:08.499Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-nova","sender":"Nova","text":"（手指停在目镜上，终于转过身）……循此苦旅，以达星辰。既然你知道这句话——回答我：为什么北极星几乎不动？","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:07:09.826Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-nova","sender":"LiuKan","text":"因为它几乎在地球的自转轴上","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:07:29.588Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-nova","sender":"Nova","text":"（极轻地点了下头）对。地轴几乎指向它，所以它悬在天极，其他星都绕着它转。\n\n\n\n拿着。求知印章。知乎那句话你该懂——有问题，就会有答案。","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:07:30.716Z"}
